EmailTemplate.textOnly:
CVMA Officers,

A new membership application has been submitted and requires your review.

APPLICANT INFORMATION:
- Name: {!Membership_Application__c.Applicant_First_Name__c} {!Membership_Application__c.Applicant_Last_Name__c}
- Email: {!Membership_Application__c.Applicant_Email__c}
- Phone: {!Membership_Application__c.Phone__c}
- Service Branch: {!Membership_Application__c.Service_Branch__c}
- Service Status: {!Membership_Application__c.Service_Status__c}
- Combat Veteran: {!Membership_Application__c.Combat_Veteran__c}
- Membership Level: {!Membership_Application__c.Membership_Level__c}
- Chapter Preference: {!Membership_Application__c.Chapter_Preference__c}

APPLICATION DETAILS:
- Application ID: {!Membership_Application__c.Name}
- Submitted: {!Membership_Application__c.Application_Date__c}
- Status: {!Membership_Application__c.Status__c}

EMERGENCY CONTACT:
- Name: {!Membership_Application__c.Emergency_Contact_Name__c}
- Phone: {!Membership_Application__c.Emergency_Contact_Phone__c}

ACTION REQUIRED:
Please review this application in Salesforce and take appropriate action:
1. Log into Salesforce
2. Navigate to the Membership Application record
3. Review all submitted information
4. Approve or reject the application

The applicant expects a response within 3-5 business days.

Vets Serving Vets
CVMA Chapter 20-7 Officer Team

This is an automated notification from the CVMA membership system.
